	<section_number>44-35</section_number>
	<catch_line>Enlistments in National Guard</catch_line>
	<text>
		Enlistments in the National Guard shall be as prescribed in existing or subsequently amended National Guard regulations.
	</text>
	<history>1930, p. 954; Michie Code 1942, § 2673(25); 1958, c. 393.</history>
